Grammar

    0 $accept: Statement $end

    1 IfStmt: If '(' Expression ')' Then Statement Done
    2       | If '(' Expression ')' Then Statement Done Else Statement

    3 If: IF

    4 Else: ELSE

    5 Done: ε

    6 Then: ε

    7 WhileLoop: While '(' Expression ')' Then1 Statement Done1

    8 While: WHILE

    9 Then1: ε

   10 Done1: ε

   11 Statement: '{' StatementList '}'
   12          | '{' '}'
   13          | Expressions
   14          | IfStmt
   15          | WhileLoop

   16 Expressions: ';'
   17            | Expression ';'

   18 StatementList: StatementList Statement
   19              | Statement

   20 Expression: DatatypeAssignments
   21           | Expression ',' DatatypeAssignments

   22 DatatypeAssignments: DATATYPE Assignments
   23                    | Assignments

   24 Assignments: ExpressionLoop
   25            | IDENTIFIER '=' Assignments

   26 ExpressionLoop: LogicalAndAritmeticExpression
   27               | LogicalAndAritmeticExpression '?' ExpressionLoop ':' ExpressionLoop

   28 LogicalAndAritmeticExpression: Term AND Term
   29                              | Term OR Term
   30                              | Term EE Term
   31                              | Term NE Term
   32                              | Term LE Term
   33                              | Term GE Term
   34                              | Term '<' Term
   35                              | Term '>' Term
   36                              | Term '|' Term
   37                              | Term '&' Term
   38                              | Term '^' Term
   39                              | Term '+' Term
   40                              | Term '-' Term
   41                              | Term '*' Term
   42                              | Term '/' Term
   43                              | Term '%' Term
   44                              | '!' Term
   45                              | UP Term
   46                              | UM Term
   47                              | Term UP
   48                              | Term UM
   49                              | Term

   50 Term: NUMBER
   51     | IDENTIFIER
   52     | '-' NUMBER
   53     | '-' IDENTIFIER
   54     | '(' Expression ')'


